0..77 Comment "// A parameter at a session type is spent by its body, as an end a fork binds"
78..153 Comment "// is. A call that moves an endpoint into such a parameter spends it at the"
154..164 Comment "// caller."
165..167 Comment "//"
168..239 Comment "// An endpoint left open at the body\'s end breaks the protocol its type"
240..313 Comment "// states. An action on an endpoint after a call took it acts on what the"
314..340 Comment "// caller no longer holds."
341..343 Comment "//"
344..421 Comment "// The checker refuses the first at the placement as `LinearResidue`, and the"
422..500 Comment "// second at the action as `UsedAfterClose`. An endpoint handed to a parameter"
501..565 Comment "// that is not a session type stays an endpoint read as a value."
566..568 Comment "//"
569..625 Comment "// - see: corpus/model/sessions/endpoint-parameter.gandr"
627..705 Comment "/// A parameter at a session type that nothing acts on: the body ends with the"
706..727 Comment "/// endpoint unspent."
